# VSIX content policy (task-1): ship only what runs.
#
# The runtime is the esbuild single-file bundle `dist/extension.cjs`; everything
# else in this folder is development input. Keep this file in sync with
# `scripts/vsix-package.mjs`, which additionally stages a clean copy before
# running vsce so a stale local build can never leak into a release artifact.
src/**
test/**
node_modules/**
dist/**/*.map
dist/**/*.d.ts
dist/**/*.js
tsconfig*.json
vitest.config.ts
.vscode/**
.eslintrc*
*.log
